== Effect ==
* Upon exploding, {{e|Bomb}}s have a 10% chance to drop a Bomb pickup.

== Notes ==
* The 10% chance to drop a bomb pickup still applies even if Isaac has a {{e|Golden Bomb}}. Because of this, it is trivial to get up to 99 bombs given enough time.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{I|Mom's Box|r}}: Having either increases the chance to 20%. Having both increases the chance to 30%.
* {{i|Curse of the Tower}} / {{i|Anarchist Cookbook}} / {{p|XVI - The Tower}}: Spawned {{e|Troll Bomb}}s can drop bomb pickups.
* {{t|Ring Cap}}: The extra bomb also has a chance to drop a bomb pickup.
* {{i|Scatter Bombs}}: Tiny bombs can drop bomb pickups.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Bomber Boy}}: The extra explosions cannot drop bomb pickups.
* {{i|Dr. Fetus}}: Shot bombs cannot drop additional bombs.
* {{i|Kamikaze!}}: Does not drop bomb pickups.
* {{i|Mr. Boom}}'s Bomb can drop bomb pickups.
* {{i|Rocket in a Jar}}: Rockets can drop bomb pickups.
* {{e|Throwable Bomb}}s from {{e|Bomb Grimace|n}}s cannot drop bomb pickups.
* {{e|Golden Troll Bomb}}s: Do not drop bomb pickups.

